        "script": "A place where every story finds hope.",
        "script_size": 46,
        "show_flourish": true,
        "text": "<p>At The Oasis, we believe that no story is too broken for redemption. The women and children who come through our doors carry stories marked by deep pain—stories of trafficking, exploitation, abuse, abandonment, and injustice. But here, those stories don’t end in tragedy. They are met with compassion, safety, and the life-changing love of God.</p><p>The Oasis is more than a program—it’s a place of restoration. A place where healing reaches every part of a person’s life: body, mind, heart, and spirit. Through outreach, education, vocational training, counseling, and safe care, we walk with women and children on a journey toward freedom, dignity, and purpose.</p><p>Women who once believed they had no future begin to dream again. Children born into cycles of exploitation begin to flourish. And what once seemed impossible becomes a living, breathing testimony of transformation.</p><p>Because at The Oasis, every story—no matter how painful—can find hope. And that hope is just the beginning of something beautiful.</p>",
