        "text": "<p>In Bangladesh, thousands of girls and women are trapped in modern-day slavery. Once trafficked, many are left with few options and little hope. The Oasis steps into that darkness with light, walking alongside women through the long journey of healing and restoration.</p><p>But restoration has a ripple effect. Women who were once enslaved are now becoming outreach workers, returning to those same places to reach others still trapped. They carry a message they know firsthand: “There’s hope. Come with me.”</p><p>The women we serve are not defined by what happened to them. They are survivors. Fighters. Artists. Leaders. And now, they are creators of beauty—beauty that you can hold in your hands.</p><p>One story inspires another.</p>",
